  ex:l7-next-33-definition a cd:Definition ; cd:body "How does matrix change the method comparison? The B-minus-A difference changes from +4 to −6 percentage points, demonstrating interaction in the synthetic cell means."@en ; cd:hasSource ex:l7-source-package ; cd:authoredResource true .
